WEBVTT

00:10:58.731 --> 00:11:01.724
and any new biological attribute
that we may find.

00:11:02.486 --> 00:11:06.640
We actually need to bring
all of our intelligence

00:11:06.664 --> 00:11:08.756
to becoming stupid again --

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:12.639
clueless [before] the immensity
of the unknown.

00:11:13.116 --> 00:11:14.477
Because after all,

00:11:14.501 --> 00:11:16.660
science is not really about knowledge.

00:11:16.684 --> 00:11:19.425
Science is about ignorance.

00:11:19.449 --> 00:11:20.814
That's what we do.

00:11:20.838 --> 00:11:23.969
Once, Antoine de Saint-Exupéry wrote,

00:11:23.993 --> 00:11:25.794
"If you want to build a ship,

00:11:25.818 --> 00:11:27.762
don't drum up people to collect wood

00:11:27.786 --> 00:11:30.088
and don't assign them tasks and work,